                                                "sense_id": "bf03ee5a-cd6d-367b-ba36-51f94853b192",
                                                "text": "Next spring the owner of the hedge will be very much surprised to find a number of his arbor vitae deceased, and he will straightway blame himself and his horse? Not he! The nurseyman, sir, must have delivered him some poor stock!"
